!96!Ebon Might On Player Power
!320!Augmentation Evoker only. The Player power bar shows the remaining Ebon Might duration instead of Mana, and uses the Player Power settings below for width, height, position, textures and text. Essence stays an ordinary Class Resource, and Mana is available through Alternative Mana. Turn this off to get a normal Mana bar back.
!96!HP Text
!320!Controls only this second HP bar. The normal Player unitframe HP text remains separate.
!96!Ironfur Cast Markers
!320!Shows one moving marker per tracked Ironfur cast. The 30 Hz motion ticker exists only while the optional tracker has active casts.
!96!Guardian Ironfur Tracker
!320!In Bear Form, replaces the empty Guardian class-resource slot with an estimated Ironfur lifetime bar. Each successful cast adds one moving marker; Ursoc's Endurance and Guardian of Elune are included.
!96!Sweeping Strikes
!320!Arms only. Shows actual aura charges in a segmented bar, using the same native display as Fury Whirlwind. These two trackers use a bar with static dividers; aura values are never read by the addon. Appearance changes during combat apply after combat.
